=head1 NAME 
qtl/qtl_form/intro.mas - a mason component for displaying an introductory
note for the qtl data submission

=AUTHOR
Isaak Y Tecle (iyt2@cornell.edu)

=cut

</%doc>

<%args>

$guide

</%args>

% if (!$guide) {$guide = 'guidelines';}

<p>QTL 資料的上傳需要在同一次連線作業中完成。因此，請在開始此流程之前準備好符合所需格式的資料檔案。請先閱讀提交 <% lc($guide) %>。如果您希望事先檢查資料集的格式，請將資料發送至(The uploading of QTL data needs to be done in one session. Therefore, prepare your data files in the required format before starting the process. Please read the submission <% lc($guide) %> first. If you would like to have the formatting of your dataset checked beforehand, send your data to)：<a href=mailto:iyt2\@cornell.edu>iyt2@cornell.edu</a>。
</p> 
        
<p>所需資料(Required data)：</p>
       
<ul>
  <li>群體的基本資訊(Some basic information about the population)，</li>
  <li>性狀資料檔案 (製表符分隔)(Traits data file (tab delimited))，</li>
  <li>表型資料檔案 (製表符分隔)(Phenotype data file (tab delimited))，</li> 
  <li>基因型資料檔案 (製表符分隔)(Genotype data file (tab delimited)) 以及(and)</li> 
  <li>統計參數(Statistical parameters)。</li>
  <li><i>標記及其序列需要已存在於 SGN 中。請閱讀<a href="/cview/help/map_submission">此處</a>以了解如何向 SGN 提交標記(Markers with their sequences need to be already in SGN. Read <a href="/cview/help/map_submission">here</a> on how to submit markers to SGN)。
  </i>
</ul>

